      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "세 번째 코스는\n황폐해진 호텔산 포켓몬들입니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼, 맛있게 드십시오.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 87,
      "offsetInSection": 6712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C1380020BC88C9F80020CF54C2A4B294000AD669D3D0D574C9C40020D638D154C0B00020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C785B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7FC002C0020B9DBC788AC8C0020B4DCC2EDC2DCC624002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네 번째 코스는\n미혹의 숲산 포켓몬들입니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼, 맛있게 드십시오.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 88,
      "offsetInSection": 6800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1240020BC88C9F80020CF54C2A4B294000ABBF8D639C7580020C232C0B00020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C785B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7FC002C0020B9DBC788AC8C0020B4DCC2EDC2DCC624002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다섯 번째 코스는\n진화의 돌을 좋아하는 포켓몬들입니다.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n그럼, 맛있게 드십시오.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 89,
      "offsetInSection": 6884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C12F0020BC88C9F80020CF54C2A4B294000AC9C4D654C7580020B3CCC7440020C88BC544D558B2940020D3ECCF13BAACB4E4C785B2C8B2E4002E00100001BE00000AADF8B7FC002C0020B9DBC788AC8C0020B4DCC2EDC2DCC624002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "축하드립니다!\n모든 승부를 소화하셨습니다!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 90,
      "offsetInSection": 6980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD95D558B4DCB9BDB2C8B2E40021000ABAA8B4E00020C2B9BD80B97C0020C18CD654D558C168C2B5B2C8B2E400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보상을 받아 주세요.",
